&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=357005&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 702/XVII/1.&amp;ordf; (PAN)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Consagra a publicidade das condena&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es por crimes e contraordena&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es relativos a maus-tratos a animais de companhia como san&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o acess&amp;oacute;ria e cria o Registo Nacional de Agressores de Animais&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377280&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 780/XVII/2.&amp;ordf; (PAN)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Criminaliza a pr&amp;aacute;tica da zoofilia refor&amp;ccedil;ando a prote&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o animal e a tutela penal e contraordenacional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=315309&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 107/XVII/1.&amp;ordf; (L)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cria o Conselho Nacional para o Bem-estar e Prote&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o Animal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=356903&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 659/XVII/1.&amp;ordf; (JPP)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Altera o Decreto-Lei n.&amp;ordm; 265/2007, de 24 de julho, alterado pelo Decreto-Lei n.&amp;ordm; 158/2008, de 8 de agosto, restringindo a exporta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de animais vivos por via mar&amp;iacute;tima para pa&amp;iacute;ses terceiros&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=356995&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 698/XVII/1.&amp;ordf; (CH)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Procede &amp;agrave; cria&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do Registo Nacional de Condenados Por Maus-Tratos a Animais (RNCMA)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377319&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 797/XVII/2.&amp;ordf; (BE)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Estabelece o regime jur&amp;iacute;dico de prote&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos animais de companhia contra maus-tratos em mat&amp;eacute;ria de alojamento e conten&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, proibindo dispositivos lesivos do bem-estar animal e criando o Plano Nacional pelo Bem-Estar dos Animais de Companhia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
