&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Audi&amp;ecirc;ncia do Movimento Pr&amp;oacute;-Associa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de Todos os Militarizados do Quadro de Pessoal Militarizado da Marinha (MPATMQPMM), sobre o c&amp;aacute;lculo das pens&amp;otilde;es de reforma&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordenador do MPATMQPMM, Joaquim Buinho&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Representante do Grupo 2 -&amp;nbsp; Policia dos Estabelecimentos de Marinha, Carlos Alves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Representante do Grupo 4 - Tro&amp;ccedil;o do Mar, Manobra, M&amp;aacute;quinas e Eletricidade, Jos&amp;eacute; Sambade&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Representante do Grupo 6 - Faroleiros e Faroleiros T&amp;eacute;cnicos, Joaquim Pessoa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;1 &amp;ndash; Informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sobre a baixa, em conex&amp;atilde;o, da seguinte iniciativa legislativa:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;- Proposta de Lei&amp;nbsp; n.&amp;ordm; 93/XVII/1.&amp;ordf; (ALRAM) - &lt;a href=&quot;https://app.parlamento.pt/webutils/docs/doc.doc?path=4FilYoX15gkfhVpXuq8cOQPMBIxa%252fS1XLL8fjOAbYfJm9kzhvBLNpEq%252bvybHXWr4S%252fwL9BshC5vw%252flgL%252fKIJ6k2cy%252bd0aoBHP5iTP7ULz72SIZGzXfsirdsg2gXWNF%252bc2plUNKUfFJo43M39orwbkk5b8I8vIT6Kwkve7GAbqZY3ZHJG35StCB40V0cV8ONvxPKcaNW2Le0pKTOMp2MOINed%252fIhCpyRpeySDMZtuYWBoHIEp6EgnQ38hmrXEz7y1H6o3W1YDThSV9atY3ZGMaztUoHD8LNYMIFU3ZnZtviqHbkSm9cf65SnFBhXLcGP14LnWzKK%252fMM6YNaUtr%252fnXCVJh7EhfHb7rL7b8l5k03BeqDWf4AY3GxdF436VFMf56&amp;amp;fich=3c306dd7-6c88-4bbe-93b7-1fd45e128fd2.doc&amp;amp;Inline=true&quot;&gt;Quinta altera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave; Lei n.&amp;ordm; 54/2005, de 15 de novembro, que estabelece a titularidade dos recursos h&amp;iacute;dricos&lt;/a&gt; &amp;ndash; a iniciativa baixou, em conex&amp;atilde;o, &amp;agrave;s 1.&amp;ordf;, 3.&amp;ordf; e 11.&amp;ordf; Comiss&amp;otilde;es | Comiss&amp;atilde;o competente: 7.&amp;ordf; Comiss&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;2 &amp;ndash; Distribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de relator das seguintes iniciativas legislativas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;- Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 806/XVII/2.&amp;ordf; (PCP) - &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377353&quot;&gt;Autoridade Mar&amp;iacute;tima Nacional&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;[Relator a designar pelo Grupo Parlamentar do PSD]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;- Projeto de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 807/XVII/2.&amp;ordf; (PCP) - &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377354&quot;&gt;Aprova a org&amp;acirc;nica da Pol&amp;iacute;cia Mar&amp;iacute;tima&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;[Relator a designar pelo Grupo Parlamentar do CH]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;3 - Discuss&amp;atilde;o e vota&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do parecer setorial na &amp;aacute;rea da defesa nacional sobre a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377352&quot;&gt;Proposta de Lei n.&amp;ordm; 110/XVII/2.&amp;ordf; (GOV)&lt;/a&gt; &amp;ndash; Aprova o Or&amp;ccedil;amento do Estado para 2027;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Relator: Deputado Lu&amp;iacute;s Dias (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;4 &amp;ndash; Discuss&amp;atilde;o, nos termos dos n.&lt;sup&gt;os&lt;/sup&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 e 2 do artigo 128.&amp;ordm; do Regimento da AR, das seguintes iniciativas:&lt;/p&gt;
